# Install after features and bugfixes

After finishing a user-facing feature or bugfix, run `scripts/rebuild-install.sh` before considering the work done. Do not stop at `xcodebuild` compile-only. The script clean-builds Release, copies to `/Applications/CajuAI.app`, and relaunches.

Skip install only for docs-only or non-code changes (for example `AGENTS.md` or comments with no binary change).
